Today the name you pick in the per-repository base picker (`develop`, `origin/develop`) is resolved to a sha and discarded.

Storing it touches:
- a new server-managed `tasks.base_branch` (single repo; not in `ALLOWED_PATCH_FIELDS`, never bumps `updated_at`);
- `repositories[].baseBranch` inside the existing JSON (no column needed);
- `createTask`, `parseTaskRepositories` and the pipeline step copy.

**Existing rows can't be backfilled.** One sha matched three refs, so they fall back to the next source.

